WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.228
Reading a page in Work.

00:00:09.228 --> 00:00:23.889
Ask for a Launch section and a lighter theme.

00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:28.889
The assistant edits the workspace files.

00:00:28.889 --> 00:00:33.189
The sidebar and theme change in place; the page stays.

00:00:33.189 --> 00:00:36.189
The assistant explains what it changed.

00:00:36.189 --> 00:00:58.409
Ask for a tool that reads your own chats.

00:00:58.409 --> 00:01:07.409
It writes a workflow and an app, then builds them.

00:01:07.409 --> 00:01:09.809
The app lands in the sidebar.

00:01:09.809 --> 00:01:16.599
Work asks once before the app reads your chats.

00:01:16.599 --> 00:01:24.122
A tool that looks built in, showing your own work.
